## Migrating an adopted custom network

GPCN™ adopts custom networks into L2 segments. After the adoption the network answers 404, and this resource can't manage it. [Migrating from `gpcn_network` to VPCs](../guides/migrating-from-gpcn-network#move-an-adopted-custom-network) walks you through moving the block to `gpcn_l2_segment` without touching live traffic.
